    "answer": {
      "short": "Refund of \\$6410.90. Total PAYG instalments: \\$36 000; tax payable: \\$29 589.10.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Taxable income} &= 122\\,680-2350\\\\\n\\text{Taxable income} &= \\$120\\,330\n\\end{align*}$$\nThe taxable income is in the \\$120 001–\\$180 000 bracket of the supplied 2022–23 tax table.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Excess} &= 120\\,330-120\\,000\\\\\n\\text{Excess} &= \\$330\\\\\n\\text{Tax payable} &= 29\\,467+0.37\\times330\\\\\n\\text{Tax payable} &= \\$29\\,589.10\\\\\n\\text{Total instalments} &= 3000\\times12\\\\\n\\text{Total instalments} &= \\$36\\,000\\\\\n\\text{Refund} &= 36\\,000-29\\,589.10\\\\\n\\text{Refund} &= \\$6410.90\n\\end{align*}$$\nWally has paid too much tax, so he receives a refund of \\$6410.90.",
